	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(30.0, 20.0, 330.0, 68.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="11">1) DATA &amp; FEATURES
Loads 8 Bingham CFD cases (x, y, time, tau_y, mu_p -&gt; Vf).
Roles &amp; types are pre-configured automatically.</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(370.0, 20.0, 270.0, 68.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="11">2) FEATURE RANKING &amp; SAMPLING
Data Sampler is set to 50% (20k rows) for fast interactive runs.
Increase to 100% anytime for full resolution.</text>
		<text id="2" type="text/plain" rect="(690.0, 20.0, 310.0, 68.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="11">3) ALL 3 SCIENTIFIC VALIDATION PROTOCOLS
- Eval 1: Random 80/20 (interpolation)
- Eval 2: 8-Fold Leave-One-Case-Out (by case_no)
- Eval 3: Future-Time Extrapolation (t &gt; 1.05 s)</text>
		<text id="3" type="text/plain" rect="(1060.0, 355.0, 460.0, 68.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="11">4) SURROGATE DIAGNOSTICS &amp; UNSEEN FLUID CONTOUR
Top/Middle: Holdout Case 4 (tau_y=20, mu_p=0.3) predictions &amp; interface error.
Bottom: Instant 6,000-node 2D contour @ t=0.5s for unseen fluid (tau_y=12, mu_p=0.15).</text>
	</annotations>
